WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.558
The three option cards introduce routes for exploration. One asks operations to

00:00:04.558 --> 00:00:09.117
handle the delivery-sequence discussion. Another asks for a later executive slot. Each

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:13.675
has conditions.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:19.729
The business decision, protective input and control-room acceptance are separate boxes. A

00:00:19.729 --> 00:00:25.592
preferred option is not ready until the relevant owners confirm their parts.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.842
A physical lunch is not merely a renamed virtual call. Location, travel,

00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:33.883
protection and monitoring scope may change. Check those conditions before making any

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:37.925
promise.
